#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Rechnung aus Lieferschein 1LS60030 fuer Artikel EINKTEIL
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Given I open an editor "1RE60030" from table "(Purchasing):(PackingSlip)" with command "INVOICE" for record from editor "1LS60030"
And I set fields
	| nummer | 1RE60030  |
	| ueb    | j         |
	| vom    | .         |
And I set field "mge" to "24" in row 1
And I set field "preis" to "10" in row 1
